<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-RESULT OF TIGER CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULT OF TIGER CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the</p>
<p>inaugural Tiger Cup soccer tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p> Thailand    1    Malaysia    0   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Third place play-off:</p>
<p> Vietnam     3    Indonesia   2</p>
</text>
